     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Building and deploying ghpages fails for the release if we are using version 0.11 of site-maven-plugin.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need to update the pom.xml for each component to 0.12 that uses it:",
