     "body": "<p>site-maven-plugin doesn't appear in the fcrepo-module-auth-rbacl or fcrepo-audit pom.xml</p>\n\n<p>Pull requests:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/861\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/861</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-message-consumer/pull/87\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-message-consumer/pull/87</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-xacml/pull/40\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-xacml/pull/40</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-camel/pull/81\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-camel/pull/81</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-client/pull/26\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-client/pull/26</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/42\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/42</a></p>",
