  "description": "<p>Building and deploying ghpages fails for the release if we are using version 0.11 of site-maven-plugin.</p>\n\n<p>We need to update the pom.xml for each component to 0.12 that uses it:<br/>\nfcrepo4<br/>\nfcrepo-message-consumer<br/>\nfcrepo-module-auth-rbacl<br/>\nfcrepo-module-auth-xacml<br/>\nfcrepo-camel<br/>\nfcrepo4-client<br/>\nfcrepo-audit<br/>\nfcrepo-camel-toolbox</p>",
